Package: rustype
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Maintainer: Nam Tran <tr.namm29@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/namtr/rustype
Provides: ibus-rustype
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), ibus (>= 1.5.0), python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Recommends: gnome-shell
Suggests: fcitx5
Description: Lightweight Vietnamese input method engine for Linux
 Rustype is a modern, high-performance, and privacy-focused Vietnamese
 input method engine for IBus.
 .
 Key features:
  * Pure Rust engine with zero external C/GUI dependencies in core.
  * Extremely low resource footprint (~450 KB binary, ~2.5 MB RAM).
  * Full Telex and VNI support with modern and traditional orthography.
  * Intelligent application-specific behavior (terminal preedit, direct mode).
  * Native GTK4 Libadwaita settings app with automatic Dark/Light theme.
  * Built-in system diagnostic health check (ibus-engine-rustype --doctor).
  * 100% offline with zero network connectivity and zero keylogging.
